---
// NoSolesLost project detail
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>NoSolesLost - Maverick Huynh</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="nav">
      <span class="nav-text">
        Sophomore at USC based in Los Angeles /
        <a href="/" class="nav-link">home</a> /
        <a href="/#about" class="nav-link">about</a>
      </span>
    </nav>

    <main class="project-page">
      <a href="/#projects" class="back-link">← Projects</a>

      <header class="project-header">
        <div class="project-header-top">
          <h1 class="project-title">NoSolesLost</h1>
          <span class="project-date">2020 - Present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-intro">
          <p>
            NoSolesLost started when I was 12, stuck at home during COVID with a pair of white sneakers and an idea. I taught myself how to hand-paint custom designs, posted the first pairs online, and suddenly people were asking if they could order one. What began as a lockdown hobby turned into my first real business.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over the years I've handled everything myself: design, production, packaging, customer communication, pricing, and marketing. That experience taught me more about product, branding, and ownership than any classroom could. It's still the clearest proof I have that if I want something to exist, I can build it end to end.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="project-meta glass-panel">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Founder</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Focus</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Custom hand-painted sneakers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Type</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Business</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-section glass-panel">
        <div class="section-logo">
          <img src="/images/Screenshot%202025-12-07%20191900-Picsart-BackgroundRemover.png" alt="NoSolesLost" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">What I built</h2>
        <p>
          Each pair is custom: sketched, painted by hand, sealed, and shipped. I learned how to turn one-off art into a repeatable product process, managing intake requests, turnaround times, and quality, even when every single design was different.
        </p>
        <p>
          But what I'll actually carry with me from NoSolesLost is the people. Every pair started with a conversation about what someone loved, a team, a memory, a color they couldn't stop thinking about, and I got to translate that into something they could wear. Some of those conversations turned into real relationships. Getting to express someone else's passion through a medium as personal as a pair of shoes on their feet is something I don't think I'll ever stop being grateful for.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="shoe-showcase">
        <div class="showcase-header">
          <p class="showcase-eyebrow">Gallery</p>
          <h2 class="showcase-title">A closer look.</h2>
          <p class="showcase-lede">
            Each pair started as someone else's idea, then became something they could wear.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="shoe-stage-panel">
          <div class="showcase-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="showcase-blob showcase-blob-1"></span>
            <span class="showcase-blob showcase-blob-2"></span>
            <span class="showcase-blob showcase-blob-3"></span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="shoe-stage"
            id="shoe-stage"
            data-src="/images/nosoleslost/geometric.png?v=4"
            data-alt="Custom geometric Air Force 1s"
            aria-label="View larger"
          >
            <img
              id="shoe-stage-img"
              src="/images/nosoleslost/geometric.png?v=4"
              alt="Custom geometric Air Force 1s"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="shoe-rail" role="list">
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item is-active" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/geometric.png?v=4" data-alt="Custom geometric Air Force 1s" aria-label="Geometric customs" aria-pressed="true">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/geometric.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/purple-drip.png?v=4" data-alt="Purple drip custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Purple drip customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/purple-drip.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/golf-yellow.png?v=4" data-alt="Yellow and green golf custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Golf customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/golf-yellow.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/bills-mafia.png?v=4" data-alt="Buffalo Bills custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Bills customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/bills-mafia.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/butterflies.png?v=4" data-alt="Blue butterfly custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Butterfly customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/butterflies.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/wazzu.png?v=4" data-alt="Washington State Wazzu custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Wazzu customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/wazzu.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/tan-p.png?v=4" data-alt="Tan and white custom Air Force 1 Shadows" aria-label="Tan customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/tan-p.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="shoe-rail-item" role="listitem" data-src="/images/nosoleslost/blue-a.png?v=4" data-alt="Blue and red custom Air Force 1s" aria-label="Blue customs" aria-pressed="false">
            <img src="/images/nosoleslost/blue-a.png?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <div class="shoe-lightbox" id="shoe-lightbox" hidden>
      <button type="button" class="shoe-lightbox-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <img src="" alt="" class="shoe-lightbox-img" />
    </div>

    <script>
      const lightbox = document.getElementById('shoe-lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = lightbox.querySelector('.shoe-lightbox-img');
      const closeBtn = lightbox.querySelector('.shoe-lightbox-close');
      const stage = document.getElementById('shoe-stage');
      const stageImg = document.getElementById('shoe-stage-img');
      const railItems = document.querySelectorAll('.shoe-rail-item');

      function openLightbox(src, alt) {
        lightboxImg.src = src;
        lightboxImg.alt = alt || '';
        lightbox.hidden = false;
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      }

      function closeLightbox() {
        lightbox.hidden = true;
        lightboxImg.src = '';
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
      }

      function selectShoe(item) {
        const src = item.dataset.src;
        const alt = item.dataset.alt || '';

        railItems.forEach((el) => {
          el.classList.toggle('is-active', el === item);
          el.setAttribute('aria-pressed', el === item ? 'true' : 'false');
        });

        stageImg.classList.add('is-fading');
        window.setTimeout(() => {
          stageImg.src = src;
          stageImg.alt = alt;
          stage.dataset.src = src;
          stage.dataset.alt = alt;
          stageImg.classList.remove('is-fading');
        }, 180);

        item.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', inline: 'center', block: 'nearest' });
      }

      railItems.forEach((item) => {
        item.addEventListener('click', () => selectShoe(item));
      });

      stage.addEventListener('click', () => {
        openLightbox(stage.dataset.src, stage.dataset.alt);
      });

      closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);
      lightbox.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target === lightbox) closeLightbox();
      });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if (e.key === 'Escape' && !lightbox.hidden) closeLightbox();
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    background-color: #f5f5f7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: pageFadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes pageFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    body {
      opacity: 1;
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 2rem;
    right: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .nav-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .nav-link {
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .project-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 7.5rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .project-page::before,
  .project-page::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .back-link,
  .project-header,
  .project-meta,
  .project-section,
  .project-photo {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-header-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .project-date {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .project-intro p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
    max-width: 46em;
  }

  .project-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .project-intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .glass-panel {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .project-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .project-photo {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .project-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-photo-caption {
    margin: 0.85rem 0.35rem 0.35rem 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #86868b;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-logo {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-logo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 72px;
    max-height: 72px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .section-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-section p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
  }

  .project-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .showcase-lede {
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #3a3a3c;
    max-width: 34em;
  }

  .shoe-showcase {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .showcase-atmosphere {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .showcase-blob {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(60px);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .showcase-blob-1 {
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    top: -20%;
    left: -10%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(186, 210, 255, 0.9) 0%, rgba(186, 210, 255, 0) 70%);
  }

  .showcase-blob-2 {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    top: -15%;
    right: -12%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230, 200, 255, 0.85) 0%, rgba(230, 200, 255, 0) 70%);
  }

  .showcase-blob-3 {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    bottom: -25%;
    left: 35%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(190, 240, 230, 0.8) 0%, rgba(190, 240, 230, 0) 70%);
  }

  .showcase-header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .showcase-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #86868b;
  }

  .showcase-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .shoe-stage-panel {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.12),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .shoe-stage-panel::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(
      125deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 0%,
      transparent 35%,
      transparent 65%,
      rgba(200, 220, 255, 0.12) 100%
    );
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .shoe-stage {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: clamp(280px, 48vw, 460px);
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: zoom-in;
  }

  .shoe-stage img {
    width: min(720px, 100%);
    height: auto;
    max-height: 380px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 28px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12));
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .shoe-stage img.is-fading {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .shoe-stage:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .shoe-stage:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #1d1d1f;
    outline-offset: -6px;
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
  }

  .shoe-rail {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.15rem 1rem 0.15rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  .shoe-rail::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .shoe-rail-item {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(110px, 18vw, 148px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 1.15rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    scroll-snap-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.12),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .shoe-rail-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(
      125deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 0%,
      transparent 35%,
      transparent 65%,
      rgba(200, 220, 255, 0.12) 100%
    );
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .shoe-rail-item img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .shoe-rail-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:
      0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.14),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .shoe-rail-item.is-active {
    border-color: rgba(29, 29, 31, 0.45);
    box-shadow:
      0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.16),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .shoe-rail-item:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #1d1d1f;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .shoe-lightbox {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(245, 245, 247, 0.78);
    backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(160%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(160%);
    cursor: zoom-out;
  }

  .shoe-lightbox[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .shoe-lightbox-img {
    max-width: min(920px, 100%);
    max-height: 85vh;
    width: auto;
